{title: 384 - Safely Through Another Week}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #384 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 384}
{meta: category Doctrines - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Safely through another [C]week God has [C7]brought us on our [F]way;
[F]Let us now a blessing [C]seek, Waiting [F]in His [C]courts [G7]to[C]day;
[C7]Day of [F]all the week the [C]best, Emblem [F]of eternal [C]rest:
[C7]Day of [F]all the week the [C]best, [F]Emblem of eter[C7]nal [F]rest.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]While [C]we seek [C7]supplies [F]of grace,
[F][C]Thro' [F]the [C]dear [G7]Redeemer's [C]name,
[C7][F]Show [C]Thy [F]reconciling [C]face;
[C7]Take [F]away [C]the [F]sin [C7]and [F]shame:
[F]From [C]our worldly [C7]cares [F]set free,
[F]May [C]we [F]rest [C]this [G7]day [C]in Thee:
[C7]From [F]our [C]worldly [F]cares [C]set free,
[C7]May [F]we [C]rest [F]this [C7]day [F]in Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]When [C]the more [C7]shall bid [F]us rise,
[F]May [C]we [F]feel [C]Thy [G7]presence [C]near;
[C7]May [F]Thy [C]glory [F]meet [C]our eyes,
[C7]While [F]we [C]in [F]Thy [C7]house [F]appear:
[F]Here [C]afford us, [C7]Lord, [F]a taste
[F][C]Of [F]our [C][G7]everlasting [C]feast:
[C7]Here [F]afford [C]us, [F]Lord, [C]a taste
[C7][F]Of [C]our [F][C7]everlasting [F]feast.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F]May [C]the [C7]gospel's [F]joyful sound
[F][C]Conquer [F]sinners, [C][G7]comfort [C]saints;
[C7]Make [F]the [C]fruits [F]of [C]grace abound,
[C7][F]Bring [C]relief [F]to [C7]all [F]complaints:
[F]Thus [C]may all [C7]our [F]Sabbaths be,
[F]Till [C]we [F]we rise [C]to [G7]reign [C]with Thee.
[C7]Thus [F]may [C]all [F]our [C]Sabbaths be,
[C7]Till [F]we [C]we rise [F]to [C7]reign [F]with Thee.
{end_of_verse}
